/IT WILL BE LOADED CORRECTLY IN 07400
/BY THE FOLLOWING BOOTSTRAP IN FIELD 0
/STARTING AT X607 (X NOT 7) WITH CLEAR, CONT
/N.B. SWITCH REGISTER MUST BE SET TO X607, DF=0
